[47.29223, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[32m─────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[32m \u001b[0m\u001b[1;33m Tool Output: research_paper_search (ok)\u001b[0m\u001b[32m \u001b[0m\u001b[32m─────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[32m─╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m Based on the provided context, \u001b[1mNOODL\u001b[0m is a neurally plausible, provable online algorithm that can be implemented as a \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m neural network for machine learning applications with streaming data.                                                \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                      \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m It solves the problem of \u001b[1mexact recovery of both factors of the dictionary learning (DL) model\u001b[0m, eliminating bias      \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m incurred by prior dictionary estimation methods and achieving linear convergence to the true factors.                \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Deciding to call tool: \u001b[1mresearch_paper_search\u001b[0m..."]
[47.298983, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[2m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[2m \u001b[0m\u001b[1;2mRetrieved Sources\u001b[0m\u001b[2m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m─────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[2m─╮\u001b[0m"]
